.TH SIGN-IMAGE 1 "October 2026" "scripts" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sign-image \- multi-layer media signing with C2PA Content Credentials, DWT-DCT steganography & OpenTimestamps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sign-image
[\fBsign\fR|\fBverify\fR|\fBstamp\fR|\fBcredentials\fR|\fBkeygen\fR] [\fIoptions\fR] \fIfile\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsign-image\fR implements multi-layered cryptographic provenance and attestation for images and visual assets:
.IP \(bu 3
\fBLevel 1 (C2PA Content Credentials):\fR Embeds a tamper-evident cryptographic provenance manifest bound to pixel hashes, signed with an X.509 certificate chain. Any pixel modification invalidates the signature.
.IP \(bu 3
\fBLevel 2 (DWT-DCT Steganography):\fR Embeds an invisible, robust watermark into the luminance (Y) frequency spectrum (Haar DWT + 8x8 block DCT). Survives aggressive re-compression (JPEG 60%, WebP 70%), resizing, metadata stripping by messengers (Telegram, Discord, Twitter), and screenshots.
.IP \(bu 3
\fBLevel 3 (OpenTimestamps / Bitcoin Blockchain):\fR Anchors the cryptographic SHA-256 digest of the media asset into the Bitcoin blockchain via decentralized calendar pools, providing immutable mathematical proof of existence at a specific point in time.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B sign \fR[\fIoptions\fR] \fIfile\fR
Signs an image with C2PA assertions, an invisible DWT-DCT watermark, and optional OpenTimestamps blockchain anchoring (\fB\-\-stamp\fR). Automatically generates persistent ES256 signing credentials in \fB~/.config/nadamu/c2pa/\fR if no custom credentials are provided.
.TP
.B verify \fR[\fB\-s\fR \fIsecret\fR] [\fB\-\-ots\fR \fIproof.ots\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] \fIfile\fR
Inspects and verifies all 3 layers: C2PA Content Credentials, invisible frequency watermarks, and OpenTimestamps Bitcoin blockchain proofs.
.TP
.B stamp \fR[\fB\-\-upgrade\fR] [\fB\-\-wait\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-force\fR] \fIfile\fR
Anchors a media file into the Bitcoin blockchain via OpenTimestamps (\fI<file>.ots\fR), or upgrades a pending \fI.ots\fR proof file once the Bitcoin block has been mined.
.TP
.B credentials \fR[\fB\-\-export\fR|\fB\-\-import-key\fR \fIkey\fR \fB\-\-import-cert\fR \fIcert\fR]
Views, exports, or imports C2PA signing credentials (private key and X.509 certificate chain). Useful for Bitwarden backups and replicating signing setups across machines.
.TP
.B keygen \fR[\fB\-d\fR \fIdomain\fR] [\fB\-\-out-dir\fR \fIdir\fR]
Generates or regenerates an ECDSA P-256 (ES256) private key and a C2PA-compliant 2-tier X.509 certificate chain (Root CA + Leaf).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIpath\fR
Destination path for the signed image (default: \fI<name>_signed.<ext>\fR).
.TP
.B \-\-in-place
Overwrites the source image directly with the signed version.
.TP
.B \-\-stamp
Anchors the signed image into the Bitcoin blockchain via OpenTimestamps (\fI<output>.ots\fR).
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-title " " \fItitle\fR
Title of the artwork or media file.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-author " " \fIauthor\fR
Author name and contact information (default: \fBDanyaNADAMU <git@nada.mu>\fR).
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-domain " " \fIdomain\fR
Domain name associated with the signer certificate (default: \fBnada.mu\fR).
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-description " " \fIdesc\fR
Custom action description embedded in the manifest.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-license " " \fItext\fR
Copyright or license notice.
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-watermark " " \fItext\fR
Custom text string to embed as invisible DWT-DCT watermark (default: \fBNADAMU\fR).
.TP
.B \-\-no-watermark
Disables invisible DWT-DCT watermarking (signs with C2PA manifest only).
.TP
.B \-\-no-c2pa
Disables C2PA manifest signing (embeds invisible DWT-DCT watermark only).
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-secret " " \fIpassphrase\fR
Secret passphrase for pseudorandom watermark block scrambling and extraction (default: SHA-256 of the C2PA private key).
.TP
.B \-\-ots \fIproof.ots\fR
Path to an explicit OpenTimestamps proof file for verification.
.TP
.B \-\-upgrade
Upgrades a pending OpenTimestamps proof file by querying remote calendar servers.
.TP
.B \-\-wait
Wait synchronously until a Bitcoin block confirmation is available.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
Overwrites existing \fI.ots\fR proof file during stamping.
.TP
.B \-\-key \fIfile\fR
Path to custom EC private key in PEM format.
.TP
.B \-\-cert \fIfile\fR
Path to custom X.509 certificate chain in PEM format.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Outputs raw verification report or C2PA manifest in JSON format.
.TP
.B \-\-export
Prints the raw private key and certificate chain in PEM format for Bitwarden vault backup.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/nadamu/c2pa/es256_private.key
Default ECDSA P-256 private key (permissions 0600).
.TP
.I ~/.config/nadamu/c2pa/es256_certs.pem
Default 2-tier X.509 certificate chain (End-entity + Root CA).
.TP
.I ~/.config/nadamu/c2pa.json
Configuration file for default author, domain, policy URL, license, watermark parameters, and auto_stamp.
